# Experiment RUNS hold raw fetched HTML/JSON from real third-party merchant stores —
# never commit those (size, and it is other people's site content). The DECISION MEMOS
# written alongside them are deliverables and ARE tracked, hence the exceptions.
# Ordering matters: re-include the directory before re-including files inside it.
experiments/*
!experiments/v2-1/
experiments/v2-1/*
!experiments/v2-1/*.md
!experiments/v2-2/
experiments/v2-2/*
!experiments/v2-2/*.md
!experiments/v2-3/
experiments/v2-3/*
!experiments/v2-3/*.md

